# seq: [{"argv": ["host", "run", "main.rce", "D", "Go(x: -3)"]}]
# output_has:
#   - "kept: trap("
# provenance: property: T46, bounded exhaustive over x in -4..4 (this test x = -3): the oracle says the call returns iff x > 0, with n = x / 2; otherwise the event is kept with the requires record.
